  "description": {
    "raw": "You divine the most vulnerable portions of your opponent’s mind and overload it with a glut of psychic information. This attack deals 1d6 points of damage per caster level (maximum 5d6). The target receives a Will save for half damage. This attack has no effect on creatures without an Intelligence score.",
